The C++ adaptation and generated preset/foliage data in src/tree* are distributed
under the GNU General Public License version 3. See COPYING and
vendor/tree-gen/LICENSE. Yard's combined executable includes this GPLv3 code;
redistribution of that executable must comply with GPLv3. Existing third-party
components retain their respective licenses (Sokol: zlib; Earcut: ISC).

The original algorithm, all species presets, turtle, foliage and utilities are
preserved unmodified in vendor/tree-gen for attribution and reproducible Blender
comparisons. The Blender user interface is not part of the port. Port changes
include C++ owned data, deterministic local random state, parent-linked skeletons,
Yard coordinate conversion, resource validation/budgets, and geometry-engine
sweeps/polygon tessellation replacing Blender's geometry operations.

Upstream's README also states that generated models may be used in any context
apart from direct sale as assets. Its original wording is retained in
vendor/tree-gen/README.md. Yard does not add asset licensing terms here.
